39. Sessionization Problem

New Session if inactivity > 30 minutes

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.functions import lag

w = Window.partitionBy(
"user_id"
).orderBy("event_time")

df = df.withColumn(
"prev_time",
lag("event_time").over(w)
)

Calculate:

event_time - prev_time > 30 min

SQL:

SELECT *,
CASE
WHEN event_time -
LAG(event_time)
OVER(
PARTITION BY user_id
ORDER BY event_time
)
> INTERVAL '30 MINUTES'
THEN 1
ELSE 0
END
FROM events;
